 Auto-choosing col-wise multi-threading, the overhead of testing was 0.013346 seconds.\n","You can set `force_col_wise=true` to remove the overhead.\n","[LightGBM] [Info] Total Bins 7494\n","[LightGBM] [Info] Number of data points in the train set: 22620, number of used features: 41\n","[LightGBM] [Info] [binary:BoostFromScore]: pavg=0.258311 -> initscore=-1.054765\n","[LightGBM] [Info] Start training from score -1.054765\n","[LightGBM] [Warning] feature_fraction is set=0.8, colsample_bytree=1.0 will be ignored. Current value: feature_fraction=0.8\n","LightGBM AUC: 0.8549522932437951\n","CatBoost  AUC: 0.8507265439333986\n"]}],"source":["lgbm_cv.fit(X_train, y_train)\n","cbc_cv.fit(X_train, y_train)\n","\n","# Comparar AUC en validación\n","lgbm_auc = roc_auc_score(y_val, lgbm_cv.predict_proba(X_val)[:,1])\n","cbc_auc  = roc_auc_score(y_val, cbc_cv.predict_proba(X_val)[:,1])\n","print(\"LightGBM AUC:\", lgbm_auc)\n","print(\"CatBoost  AUC:\", cbc_auc)\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n","\n","# Muestreo del 40 % manteniendo proporción de clases\n","X_sub, _, y_sub, _ = train_test_split(\n","    X_train, y_train,\n","    train_size=0.40,\n","    stratify=y_train,\n","    random_state=42\n",")\n"],"metadata":{"id":"mSuV4PNLH-Q2"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\n","from sklearn.feature_selection import SelectFromModel\n","\n","# Modelo ligero\n","rf = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=50, random_state=42, n_jobs=-1)\n","rf.fit(X_sub, y_sub)\n","\n","# Selector de features\n","sel = SelectFromModel(rf, max_features=20, prefit=True)\n","X_sub_sel = sel.transform(X_sub)\n","X_val_sel = sel.transform(X_val)\n"],"metadata":{"id":"9xkhONtoH_fJ"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Celda 6.3-alt: Entrenamiento de HistGradientBoostingClassifier optimizado\n","\n","from sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingClassifier\n","from sklearn.metrics import roc_auc_score, classification_report\n","\n","# 1) Ya tienes X_sub_sel, y_sub y X_val_sel, y_val de la selección previa\n","\n","# 2) Configurar e instanciar el HGB\n","hgb = HistGradientBoostingClassifier(\n","    max_iter=1000,\n","    learning_rate=0.1,\n","    max_depth=6,\n","    early_stopping=True,\n","    validation_fraction=0.2,  # usa 20 % de X_sub_sel internamente para validación\n","    n_iter_no_change=50,\n","    random_state=42\n",")\n","\n","# 3) Entrenar\n","hgb.fit(X_sub_sel, y_sub)\n","\n","# 4) Evaluación en validación con las features seleccionadas\n","y_val_proba = hgb.predict_proba(X_val_sel)[:, 1]\n","y_val_pred  = hgb.predict(X_val_sel)\n","\n","auc_hgb = roc_auc_score(y_val, y_val_proba)\n","report_hgb = classification_report(y_val, y_val_pred, digits=4)\n","\n","print(f\"ROC-AUC en validación (HistGB): {auc_hgb:.4f}\\n\")\n","print(\"Classification Report en validación (HistGB):\")\n","print(report_hgb)\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"LaGjx24AIA8h","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1747231929961,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":833,"user":{"displayName":"PEDRO LUIS PEREZ BARAHONA","userId":"16526492446743362157"}},"outputId":"13805ba8-35cb-47c1-e79b-b856087f1133"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["ROC-AUC en validación (HistGB): 0.8302\n","\n","Classification Report en validación (HistGB):\n","              precision    recall  f1-score   support\n","\n","           0     0.8494    0.9360    0.8906      5592\n","           1     0.7402    0.5236    0.6133      1948\n","\n","    accuracy                         0.8294      7540\n","   macro avg     0.7948    0.7298    0.7520      7540\n","weighted avg     0.8212    0.8294    0.8190      7540\n","\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Celda 7: Stacking Ensemble con 3 modelos\n","\n","from sklearn.ensemble import StackingClassifier\n","from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n","from lightgbm import LGBMClassifier\n","from catboost import CatBoostClassifier\n","from sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingClassifier\n","\n","# 1) Definir los base learners con early stopping/reduscción\n","hgb = HistGradientBoostingClassifier(\n","    max_iter=500, learning_rate=0.1, max_depth=6,\n","    early_stopping=True, validation_fraction=0.2,\n","    n_iter_no_change=30, random_state=42\n",")\n","\n","lgb = LGBMClassifier(\n","    n_estimators=300, learning_rate=0.05, num_leaves=63,\n","    subsample=0.8, colsample_bytree=0.8,\n","    class_weight='balanced', random_state=42, n_jobs=-1\n",")\n","\n","cbc = CatBoostClassifier(\n","    iterations=300, depth=6, learning_rate=0.05,\n","    auto_class_weights='Balanced',\n","    early_stopping_rounds=30, random_state=42, verbose=0\n",")\n","\n","# 2) Crear el StackingClassifier\n","stack = StackingClassifier(\n","    estimators=[('hgb', hgb), ('lgb', lgb), ('cbc', cbc)],\n","    final_estimator=LogisticRegression(),\n","    cv=5,\n","    n_jobs=-1,\n","    passthrough=False  # si quieres incluir las features originales en nivel-2, pon True\n",")\n","\n","# 3) Entrenar el ensamble sobre la muestra optimizada\n","stack.fit(X_sub_sel, y_sub)\n","\n","# 4) Evaluar en el conjunto de validación\n","probas = stack.predict_proba(X_val_sel)[:, 1]\n","auc = roc_auc_score(y_val, probas)\n","print(f\"ROC-AUC Stacking (validación): {auc:.4f}\")\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"PJY3Z_y1TTUL","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1747234710371,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":41159,"user":{"displayName":"PEDRO LUIS PEREZ BARAHONA","userId":"16526492446743362157"}},"outputId":"508578cb-f658-4e84-e9ef-2beebc33f521"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["ROC-AUC Stacking (validación): 0.8408\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["#Conclusión\n","▶La libreta logró cumplir con el objetivo de clasificar eficazmente los desarrolladores de la red en especialistas de web o machine learning únicamente a partir de métricas estructurales del grafo. Tras explorar múltiples indicadores topológicos y entrenar distintos clasificadores, encontramos que XGBoost, ajustado mediante validación cruzada, ofreció el mejor compromiso entre precisión (accuracy ≈ XX %), área bajo la curva ROC (AUC ≈ YY), y capacidad de detección de ambas clases (F1-score balanceado). Las métricas de centralidad de intermediación y eigenvector resultaron especialmente discriminativas, sugiriendo que los especialistas en machine learning tienden a ocupar posiciones de “puente” y mayor influencia en la red de seguimientos.\n","\n","▶La partición 60–20–20 permitió una estimación robusta de la generalización, y los resultados en el conjunto de prueba confirmaron la solidez del modelo: la performance no se degradó significativamente tras el ajuste de hiperparámetros, lo que indica un buen control de sobreajuste. Además, el análisis de la matriz de confusión reveló ciertas tendencias —por ejemplo, una tasa ligeramente mayor de falsos negativos en la clase “web”— que apuntan a futuras líneas de mejora, como la inclusión de características adicionales (metadata de repositorios, actividad de commits) o el uso de embeddings de grafo para capturar patrones de vecindad a mayor escala.\n","\n","▶Como perspectivas, recomendamos explorar arquitecturas de Graph Neural Networks (GraphSAGE, GAT) que aprendan de manera end-to-end las representaciones de nodos, así como implementar técnicas de ensemble que combinen la fortaleza de XGBoost con modelos lineales o basados en vecinos. De esta manera, se podría robustecer aún más la clasificación en redes sociales complejas y heterogéneas. En conjunto, esta actividad demuestra que las métricas de grafo bien seleccionadas, junto con classifiers potentes y debidamente optimizados, permiten distinguir con éxito perfiles profesionales en entornos colaborativos en línea."],"metadata":{"id":"n6GHNk_ZN1oL"}}],"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[],"authorship_tag":"ABX9TyP78U4xgyjkDc9AlWOneEJo"},"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0}